        "language_view": {
            "description": "Gorsemere FCC GM-7. Plant-owned Fe-57 Mössbauer reconstructs 1.20 mm/s isomer shift from 0.040*(42.00-12.00) and f_Fe3 0.80 from 4.80/6.00 while Mossveil still shows 0.22 mm/s and dense-bed O2 1.80 percent. The gate MODIFYs combustion air to 0.85 pu. A 24 min regenerator settle floor is serialized in the stream. Companion t2 ACCEPTs the 0.85 hold and refuses a Mossveil restore.",
            "trajectory": traj,
            "trajectory_air_hold_execution": traj2,
        },
        "bridge_notes": {
