                "reconstruction as event: recon.d 1.20 equals 0.040*(42.00-12.00)",
                "MODIFY then operational ACCEPT: gate.air at 5700 s, gate.exec at 9600 s",
                "slow floor in-stream: soak.start 6600 s, soak.floor 8040 s (24.0 min)",
